00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.670
Those who violate the rules are to receive 80 strokes of the cane.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:19.870
Have you heard of Miaojiang's

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:20.930
bonfire festival?

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.270
