00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:17.280
Ten volumes.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:18.030
Good.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.480
You've memorized more than I have.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:21.260
Remember,

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:22.720
