I can't get it open! What do we do?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.080
Look for the keys!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.240
Go!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.550
Take the books and go!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.910
